      "description": "Looking for a princess game where you can design everything?\nPrincess Town Dream House lets you create the ultimate royal world - from styling characters to building dream castles, just like your favorite creative games but with magical princess flair!\n\nWhat can you customize in this princess world?\n• Make a unique princess character\nChange every detail from eye color to shoe style, with more options than most dress-up games\n• Best home design game for kids\nDecorate rooms that actually feel lived-in, with furniture you can move and resize freely\n• Design a whole town\nPlace bakeries, gardens and more - then watch characters use what you've built\n\nWhy do players say this feels different?\n• \"Is there a game where decorating actually matters?\"\nYes! Characters react when you create beautiful spaces\n• \"I want a dress-up game that's not just clothes\"\nHere, your designs affect the story - throw parties in your decorated castle\n\nHow is this princesses game?\n• Same open-ended play, but with royal storytelling\n• All the creative freedom, plus magical transformations\n• Familiar drag-and-drop controls with extra sparkle\n\nThe perfect game for kids who:\n• Keep asking for more customization in dress-up games\n• Love seeing their designs come to life\n• Want princess stories they can control\n\nFor parents searching:\n• \"creative princess game\"\n• \"kids game where you build and decorate\"\n• \"dress up game with home design\"\n\nStart designing - your kingdom grows with every choice!\n\nSubscription Details:\n$2.99/week unlocks premium access. Auto-renews unless canceled 24h before renewal.\nCharges billed to Apple ID. Trials end at subscription.\nTOS: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy: https://www.privacypolicygenerator.info/live.php?token=6sSgtRE9QeOG9ZW73usCGwXn76XpGRt4\nBy installing, you agree to our terms. Some 3rd-party services may apply.",
